    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "OUR LITTLE SECRET"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/alternativeHeadline": [
      {
        "@value": "A TRUE, NEW MUSICAL"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@value": "Our Little Secret is the hilarious, moving, and completely true story of Noam Tomaschoff’s discovery that he wasn’t an only child, and he actually had more than 35 siblings around the world. Blending comedy, drama, and addictive music, Our Little Secret will leave you laughing, crying — and seeing your family in a whole new light.\nMain Stage Premiere and Developmental Production by the Segal Centre for Performing Arts, Montreal (Lisa Rubin, Artistic & Executive Director, Jon Rondeau, General Manager), April 2025.\nSpecial thanks:\nDanielle Peters, Ben Deverett, Rose Bochner, Josh Sable\nProduction Counsel: David Manella\nU.S. General Manager: Sam Dallas, Envoy Theatricals\nTracey Erin Smith, Original Director (Segal Centre Production)\nChris Barillaro, Original piano arrangements\nCitadel Theatre is a member of the Professional Association of Canadian Theatres and engages professional Artists who are members of the Canadian Actors’ Equity Association under the terms of the jointly negotiated Canadian Theatre Agreement.\nProduction personnel for the Citadel Theatre are members of the International Alliance of Theatrical Stage Employees (I.A.T.S.E)\n"
      }
    ]
  },
